DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");
Context()->flags->set(reduceConstantFunctions=>0);
Context()->flags->set(reduceConstants=>0);

$fun_2 = Formula("sqrt((ln((e^(x)))))");
$fun_1 = Formula("9-(4*x)");

Context("Interval");

$set_ans_3 = Compute("[2, infinity) U (1, 5)");
$set_ans_4 = Compute("[2, infinity) U (1, 5) U [2, infinity) U (1, 5)");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("{-7, 3} U {-7, 3} - ((-infinity, infinity) - (10, infinity)) U (10, infinity)");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("(10, infinity) U ({-7, 3} U {-7, 3})");

Context("Vector");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

[`13*17+18/19`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Real(221.947368421),width=>4}
---

What is the value of [`8*1+6`]? [_____]{answer=>Formula('14'),width=>9}
---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x > 9\}`]
- [`B = \{-7, 3\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup B \cap A \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`A \cup (B \cup B) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | 1 < x < 5\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \geq 2\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}
- [`B \cup A \cup B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle -6, 8, 7 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle -5, 4, 10 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{w} = \langle -6, 2, 10 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{v} \times \vec{w} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-5, 4, 10>") x Compute("<-6, 2, 10>")}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-5, 4, 10>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-6, 8, 7>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<-6, 8, 7>"))}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle -9, -2, 7 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 8, -6, -7 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{w} = \langle -2, 8, -6 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{w} \cdot \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-2, 8, -6>") . Compute("<-9, -2, 7>")}
- [` \left\| \vec{v} \right\| = `] [_____]{norm(Compute("<8, -6, -7>"))}
- [` \vec{v} \times \vec{w} = `] [_____]{Compute("<8, -6, -7>") x Compute("<-2, 8, -6>")}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-9, -2, 7>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}

---

Given this function:

>> [`[$fun_1]`] <<

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->D()}
- [`f'(4) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->eval(x=>4)}
- [`f'(5) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->eval(x=>5)}

---

Given this function:

>> [`[$fun_2]`] <<

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()}
- [`f'(4) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()->eval(x=>4)}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
